gin":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-10-01T08:54:39Z","updated_at":"2025-11-25T15:56:54Z","closed_at":"2025-11-25T15:56:53Z","assignee":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in:\n- v4.5.stable.official [876b29033]\n- v4.6.dev1.official [8d8041bd4]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - macOS Sequoia (15.6.1) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M3 Pro (Apple9) - Apple M3 Pro (12 threads) - 36.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWriting to a closed pipe crashes the whole process.\n\nI'm currently writing a tool script which has to interact with an external CLI binary.\nTo achieve this I use OS.execute_with_pipe() in a non-blocking way.\nThe CLI expects payloads to be passed through stdin which I access over a FileAccess.\nThe issue with this is, that in some circumstances the CLI tool exits before I finish all my store statements.\n\nActual Behavior: \nWhen I write to stdio of an exited process the whole engine gets terminated. (probably because a SIGPIPE is sent but not handled in any way)\n\nExpected Behavior:\nAs per the FileAccess documentation of the store commands and analog to a failed file write, I expect the command to just return false when writing to a closed pipe.\n(Or some other form of graceful error)\n\nThe if statement\n```gdscript\nif (proc[\"stdio\"] as FileAccess).is_open() and OS.is_process_running(proc[\"pid\"]):\n```\nwas supposed to be a workaround to check wether the process has already exited but it doesn't work.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new project\n2. Create a new script file\n3. Paste following code:\n```gdscript\n@tool\n\nextends EditorScript\n\nfunc _run() -> void:\n\tprint(\"run\")\n\n\t# Test both scenarios: crashing and non-crashing\n\tminimal_crash_example()\n\nfunc minimal_crash_example():\n\tvar proc := OS.execute_with_pipe(\"/bin/echo\", PackedStringArray(), false)\n\tOS.delay_msec(10)\n\tif (proc[\"stdio\"] as FileAccess).is_open() and OS.is_process_running(proc[\"pid\"]):\n\t\t(proc[\"stdio\"] as FileAccess).store_buffer(PackedByteArray([0]))\n```\n4. Execute the script (File > Run)\n\nThe reproduction project already contains this script so you just need to execute it as in step 4\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[playground 2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22634087/playground.2.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111110/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111110/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}